                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Kuiying Wang",
                        "email": "wangkuiying.wky@alibaba-inc.com",
                        "username": "kuiyingw"
                    },
                    "message": "pcieslot_device is sub device under pcieslot or peer at the same level? which one is prefer?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "include/smbios_mdrv2.hpp",
                    "line": 174,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Christian Walter",
                        "email": "christian.walter@9elements.com",
                        "username": "walterchris"
                    },
                    "message": "Peers at the same level, linked by a contained_by/containing D-Bus association. bmcweb's PCIeDevice handler follows this association to read slot properties (Generation, Lanes, SlotType) from the linked PCIeSlot object.\n\nI'll rename pcieslot_device to pciedevice to better match the Redfish resource name. WDYT?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "include/smbios_mdrv2.hpp",
                    "line": 174,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Kuiying Wang",
                        "email": "wangkuiying.wky@alibaba-inc.com",
                        "username": "kuiyingw"
                    },
                    "message": "right, pciedevice is better."
                }
            ],
